Vendor file provenance
======================

File:    mermaid.min.js (lives next to this LICENSE)
Source:  https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mermaid@10.9.3/dist/mermaid.min.js
         (npm package "mermaid", version 10.9.3, UMD build)
Used by: previewer_render_text.py – Mermaid diagrams in the Markdown
         preview, strictly opt-in via the settings (F87, 1.17.0);
         served to the webview through the private previewer-res:
         URI scheme.
Note:    mermaid.min.js is NOT part of the version lock; it is a
         third-party asset. Without it (or with the opt-in off) the
         mermaid fences render as ordinary code blocks.

